02:26:54.340 --> 02:26:57.640
safer for vehicles. Those are normally side collisions instead of head

02:26:58.140 --> 02:27:01.660
ons. And because people are slowing down and vehicles coming into roundabouts.

02:27:02.160 --> 02:27:05.900
However, as you know, we've just put in some devices at three

02:27:06.400 --> 02:27:09.940
locations around the region. We're going to kick off a pilot this fall related to

02:27:10.340 --> 02:27:13.860
pedestrian safety at roundabouts, which is really related

02:27:14.020 --> 02:27:17.500
to. I can tell you that it is safer. But I

02:27:18.000 --> 02:27:21.180
know when we cross, and I do so with my children, it doesn't

02:27:21.680 --> 02:27:25.020
feel like that because the red light and the protected box really feels like

02:27:25.520 --> 02:27:27.740
